Description: Administration web UI for Office Unbound (admin-web)
 Single-page React application (compiled from the pinned upstream tag with a
 locked yarn tree, see the package SBOM) that talks to ou-admin-api. Static
 files in /usr/share/grommunio-admin-web, an nginx location snippet is shipped
 as an example under /usr/share/doc/ou-admin-web/examples.
